 County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. October to November came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, March to April and August to September each came in at 61% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 20897 had its driest year in 1988 at 74% of normal.</p>"}
